  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"aligncenter\" alt=\"Stony Brook Grist Mill\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"image-sizes\">Sizes: <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">150 × 150</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">300 × 225</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">1,024 × 768</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">175 × 131</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">667 × 500</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\">1,280 × 960</a></span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>Although the Grist Mill is not open to the public we artists were more than rewarded with a spectacular day on this beautifully clean crisp day 6/19/20.<br />\nLots of shadows and sunshine, trickling waterfalls where the herring run, blooms and egrets. </p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\"><p data-fidelity-note=\"size-options\" class=\"note\">Historical image-size options link to the archived original image. Separate resized downloads are not reproduced.</p>\n\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-27T12:16:22-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 27, 2020, 12:16 pm\">June 27, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
